{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo version of <strong>&quot;Aylin: The Story of Tom&quot;</strong> allows players to experience the Prologue. It offers approximately 15 minutes of gameplay and uses the same mechanics as the full version. The only difference is that the demo ends at a specific point in the story. Progress made in the demo will not carry over to the full game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874310/extras/de2069f0f311b52829e3e7fced073b2f.avif?t=1752801156\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874310/extras/1a417efebb78b869a99a661b8f756dd9.avif?t=1752801156\" /></div><strong>A fictional horror story about Tom, whose daughter underwent a heart transplant he tragically couldn't attend.</strong> As Tom drives to pick her up from the hospital, he finds only chaos. The facility is in ruins\u2014dark, abandoned, and eerily silent. Now, Tom must find his daughter in the shadowy halls of the desolate hospital and try to save her. But he faces a terrifying ordeal, as hostile forces lurking within attempt to kill him and drag him into their nightmarish world.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874310/extras/1d417e71d6d1e2c0850ccaa5aeb1fba7.avif?t=1752801156\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874310?t=1752801156","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874310/c1bc45155e02dbd8b854cb7cedad7f824c118123/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752801156","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874310/04f1882e34bc5409035f5f94b53e3d4cc5bfa4dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752801156","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874310/04f1882e34bc5409035f5f94b53e3d4cc5bfa4dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752801156","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Player Warnings:\r\n\r\nThe game contains intense horror scenes, violence, and blood-related content. It may evoke strong emotions and feelings of unease.\r\n\r\nIntended for adults or players with parental/guardian consent due to mature themes.\r\n\r\nIt is recommended to play in a safe environment and not during activities that require full attention (e.g., driving).\r\n\r\nIf you have a history of anxiety, panic attacks, or heart conditions, please exercise caution or consider avoiding the game.\r\n\r\nSudden audio and visual effects (jump scares) may occur throughout the gameplay.\r\n\r\nThe game may include scenes unsuitable for younger audiences \u2014 make sure it\u2019s appropriate for you.\r\n\r\nTake breaks during extended play sessions \u2014 your health and comfort come first.\r\n\r\nIf you feel unwell or overly stressed, stop playing immediately."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo version of <strong>&quot;Aylin: The Story of Tom&quot;</strong> allows players to experience the Prologue. It offers approximately 15 minutes of gameplay and uses the same mechanics as the full version. The only difference is that the demo ends at a specific point in the story. Progress made in the demo will not carry over to the full game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874310/extras/de2069f0f311b52829e3e7fced073b2f.avif?t=1752801156\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874310/extras/1a417efebb78b869a99a661b8f756dd9.avif?t=1752801156\" /></div><strong>A fictional horror story about Tom, whose daughter underwent a heart transplant he tragically couldn't attend.</strong> As Tom drives to pick her up from the hospital, he finds only chaos. The facility is in ruins\u2014dark, abandoned, and eerily silent. Now, Tom must find his daughter in the shadowy halls of the desolate hospital and try to save her. But he faces a terrifying ordeal, as hostile forces lurking within attempt to kill him and drag him into their nightmarish world.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874310/extras/1d417e71d6d1e2c0850ccaa5aeb1fba7.avif?t=1752801156\" /></div></p>","developers":["SkorBartStudio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3865540","name":"Aylin: The Story of Tom"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874310/93848affbe111126a661aa980d80626906637723/header.jpg?t=1752801156","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 SkorBartStudio and SkorBartInteractive. All rights reserved. Aylin: The Story of Tom is a trademark of SkorBartStudio.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3 or AMD Ryzen\u2122 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon\u2122 RX 480<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5 or AMD Ryzen\u2122 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 1660 or AMD Radeon\u2122 RX 580<br></li><li>